Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn you, WalletNook.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死的皮夹购物网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:16.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The online description was completely misleading.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:16.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在线的产品说明完全是误导
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:18.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They said eight slots plus removable ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:18.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们说能放八张卡 加上一个活动式证件夹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To any rational person, that would mean room for nine cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以合理的推断 它应该能放九张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:24.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But they don't tell you, the removable ID takes up one slot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:24.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们没告诉我 活动式证件夹早就算进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.11,0:00:27.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.11,0:00:27.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这简直是场恶梦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, now, do you really need...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你真的需要…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:32.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the honorary Justice League of America membership card?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:32.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}美国正义联盟荣誉会员卡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's been in every wallet I've owned since I was 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从五岁拥有它之后 就一直放在皮夹里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:38.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:38.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:41.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It says, "Keep this on your person at all times."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:41.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上面说“永远把它带在身边”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCK ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就在这里 蝙蝠侠的签名下面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's right here, under Batman's signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:50.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And this is Leonard and Sheldon's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:50.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是莱纳德跟谢尔顿的家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:52.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLES] Guess whose parents just got broadband.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:52.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猜猜看谁的爸妈刚刚装了宽带
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:56.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, may I present, live from New Delhi, Dr. and Mrs. V. M. Koothrappali?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:56.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我要介绍 住在新德里的库萨帕里夫妇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:58.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:58.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tilt up the camera. I'm looking at his crotch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将摄像头往上拉 我只看到他的裆部
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.98,0:01:02.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.98,0:01:02.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:04.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, that's much better. Hi. -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:04.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-现在好多了 嗨 -嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:08.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-And over here is Sheldon. SHELDON: Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:08.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这一位是谢尔顿 -嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:09.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He lives with Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:09.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跟莱纳德住在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:13.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that's nice. Like Haroon and Tanvir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:13.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不错 跟哈伦与塔维尔一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:14.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, not like Haroon and Tanvir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:14.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 他们跟哈伦与塔维尔不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:16.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. KOOTHRAPPALI: Such sweet young men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:16.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们都是很善良的年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.62,0:01:19.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They just adopted the cutest little Punjabi baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.62,0:01:19.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们才刚收养了 一个非常可爱的旁遮普婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. No, we're not like Haroon and Tanvir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 不 我们跟哈伦及塔维尔不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.21,0:01:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So are you boys academics like our son? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.21,0:01:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们跟我儿子一样是学者？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your parents are comfortable with limited earning potential?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们爸妈能接受 你们赚不了什么钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:30.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, yes. -Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:30.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以 -完全不在意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:32.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Papa, please don't start.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:32.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸 拜托你别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? It's just a question. He's so sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么？我只是问问 他太敏感了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:37.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's my life, my friends. Good to see you. Say bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:37.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的生活、我的朋友 很高兴能见到你们 说再见吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:38.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Bye. -Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:38.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再见 -再见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}DR. KOOTHRAPPALI: Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before you go, we have good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在你离开前 我们有好消息要宣布
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:46.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Put the computer down and gather your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:46.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放下电脑 把你的朋友们都叫过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:53.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What is it, Papa? -I don't see your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:53.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么事 爸爸？ -我看不到你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:02:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it just me or does web-chatting with your clothes on seem a little pointless?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:02:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有我这么觉得 还是穿着衣服 上网聊天本来就没什么意义呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rajesh, do you remember Lalita Gupta?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉希 你还记得拉丽妲古普塔吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:07.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The little fat girl that used to kick me in the samosas and call me untouchable?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:07.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个常踢我的“元宝” 骂我没用的胖女孩？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. Well, now she's a dental student at USC...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 现在她是南加大牙医系的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:13.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so we gave her your contact information.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:13.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们给了她你的联络方式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:15.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:15.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么你们要那么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:17.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're 26 years old, Rajesh. We want grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:17.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你26岁了 拉吉希 我们想抱孙子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:21.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-But, Papa, I'm not supposed-- -Lalita's parents approved the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:21.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-爸爸 我不应该… -拉丽妲的爸妈同意这婚姻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:24.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you decide on a spring wedding, we can avoid monsoon season.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:24.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你想在春天结婚 我们可以避开雨季
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:26.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A spring wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:26.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}春天结婚？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's up to you. We don't want to meddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}由你决定 我们不想干涉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't want to meddle, why are you meddling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你们不想干涉 为什么你们还在干涉？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:33.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your parents don't consider this meddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:33.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}容我说句话 或许你爸妈不觉得这是干涉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While arranged marriages are no longer the norm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然包办婚姻已经不是常态…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:39.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Indian parents continue to have an involvement in their children's love lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:39.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}印度的父母还是喜欢 大力干涉孩子的爱情生活
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:42.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you telling me about my own culture?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:42.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么要告诉我 我自己国家的文化？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:44.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You seemed confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:44.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你似乎很困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:50.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sorry, but with all due respect, I don't-- -I'm sorry, darling. We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:50.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-抱歉 妈妈爸爸 我无意不敬 我… -对不起 儿子 我们得下线了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:52.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doogie Howser is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:52.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《天才小医生》要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:55.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Grandma, it's Doogie time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:55.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}奶奶 《天才小医生》要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Bye-bye. -Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再见 -再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.77,0:03:06.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doogie Howser's been off the air for like 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.77,0:03:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《天才小医生》已经停播20年了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:10.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I read that it's one of the most popular programs in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:10.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上我知道 那是印度最受欢迎的节目之一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Might speak to a cultural aspiration to have one's children enter the medical profession.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这跟他们的文化相呼应 他们都希望孩子能上医学院
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:16.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: I bet you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:16.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -我想你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I bet they love Scrubs. -What's not to love?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他们一定喜欢《实习医生风云》 -有什么好不喜欢的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:24.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My parents are trying to marry me off to a stranger. What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:24.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸妈要我娶一个陌生人 我该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:27.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I suggest you go through with it. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:27.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我建议你接受他们的安排 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:32.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Romantic love as the basis for marriage has only existed since the 19th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:32.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}19世纪后 人们才相信婚姻的基础是爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:36.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Up until then, arranged marriages were the norm and it served society quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:36.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}之前包办婚姻很普遍 也在社会上发挥了一定功能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:38.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the premise of Fiddler on the Roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:38.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《屋顶上的提琴手》 就是以这个作为前提的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:41.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not a big fan of musicals, but I love that show.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:41.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不太喜欢音乐剧 但我喜欢那一部剧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:43.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too. Of course, it speaks to me culturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:43.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是 当然那也符合我的文化背景
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Understandable, but there's a universality to that story which transcends ethnicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂 但那个故事的主题 放诸天下各种族皆准
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:51.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's not forget it's got some really catchy tunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:51.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别忘了那部剧 还有让人琅琅上口的歌曲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, yeah. -Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 -当然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:54.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I know what I'm gonna do. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:54.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我知道我该怎么办了 -怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:56.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Find new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:56.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}交新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:01.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR OPENS, CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:05.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So who wants to rent Fiddler? -No need. We have the special edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:05.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谁去租《屋顶上的提琴手》？ -不用 我们有特别版
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:11.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe we are like Haroon and Tanvir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:11.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们是跟哈伦及塔维尔一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:36.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is Dr. Sheldon Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:36.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是谢尔顿库珀博士
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I need to cancel my membership to the planetarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:40.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要取消天文馆的会员身分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHING NOISELESSLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, I'm sorry too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我也很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:46.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but there's just no room for you in my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:46.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我的皮夹放不下你们的会员证
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I understand, but it was between you and the Museum of Natural History...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我了解 我得在 你们跟自然历史博物馆间选择
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.17,0:04:54.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and frankly, you don't have dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.17,0:04:54.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老实说 你们没有恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:58.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'll miss you too. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:58.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也会想念你们的 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:03.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I know you're texting about me and I'd really like you to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:03.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你们在发有关我的短信 我希望你们不要那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:04.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCK ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:08.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, dear, I am rightly and truly screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:08.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 我真的彻底完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:10.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought you were finding new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:10.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你去找新朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:12.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got some feelers out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:12.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去试探过一些了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:15.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the meantime, listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同时 你们听听这个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:17.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ON RECORDING] Hi, Rajesh, this is Lalita Gupta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:17.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 拉吉希 我是拉丽妲古普塔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.03,0:05:21.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your mother gave my mother your phone number to give to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.03,0:05:21.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你妈要我妈把你的电话号码给我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:25.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I'm calling you and call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:25.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我打电话给你 请回电
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.87,0:05:27.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.87,0:05:27.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:30.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you believe how pushy she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:30.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们能相信她有多急不可耐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:33.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So don't call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就别打电话给她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I don't call her, I won't hear the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不打电话给她 我爸妈会跟我没完没了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:39.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So call her. -How can I call her? I can't talk to women.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:39.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那就打电话给她 -我怎么打？我没办法跟女人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm done. Anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有点子了 谁要说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:42.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:43.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Give me the phone. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:43.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-把电话给我 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.09,0:05:46.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just give it to me. Sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.09,0:05:46.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:49.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you doing? -Don't worry, you'll thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在做什么？ -别担心 你会感谢我的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:52.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IMITATING RAJESH] Hello, Lalita? Raj Koothrappali.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:53.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂 拉丽妲吗？我是拉吉希库萨帕里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:54.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.19,0:05:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, it is good to talk to you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.19,0:05:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我也很高兴能跟你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在穿什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:06.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:06.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So anyhow, when would you like to meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之你何时要跟我见面？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friday works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}星期五我有空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:16.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll call you with a time and place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:16.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再打电话告诉你时间跟地点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the meantime, keep it real, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}悠着点 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[NORMAL VOICE] You may now thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你可以感谢我了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.68,0:06:31.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For what, making me sound like a Simpsons character?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.68,0:06:31.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？因为你让我听起来 跟《辛普森一家》里的角色差不多？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:34.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Next time, make your own date. -Didn't wanna make this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:34.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 下次你自己约女生 -我根本不想约这个女生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look on the bright side, she might turn out to be a nice, beautiful girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}往好的方面想 她或许是个大美女呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great, we get married, I won't be able to talk to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了 我们会结婚 而我不能跟她说话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:44.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and we'll spend the rest of our lives in total silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:44.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会沉默地度过一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It worked for my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:46.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸妈就可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:47.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCK ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.07,0:06:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi, guys. -Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.07,0:06:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大家好 -嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:50.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need guinea pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:50.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要实验对象
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, there's a lab animal supply company in Reseda you could try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 雷赛达有家实验动物公司 你可以去试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if your research is going to have human applications, I suggest white mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你的实验跟人体有关 我建议你用小白鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.25,0:07:02.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Their brain chemistry is far closer to ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.25,0:07:02.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它们的脑部化学成分 跟人类比较接近
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:07.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I swear to God, Sheldon, one day, I'm gonna get the hang of talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:07.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我发誓 有一天我会听懂你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His mom's been saying that for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多年来他妈妈一直这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.89,0:07:15.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's up? -Well, I convinced the restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.89,0:07:15.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -我说服了餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:18.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to give me a bartending shift so I need to practice mixing drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:18.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我当调酒师 所以我得练习调酒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:22.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, well, great. The key to acquiring proficiency in any task is repetition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:22.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了 什么事情都是熟能生巧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:24.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With certain obvious exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:24.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些事是例外
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:28.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Suicide, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:28.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比如自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Leonard, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:37.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, we'd love to help you, but Raj is going through some stuff right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:37.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我们很想帮忙 但拉吉出了点状况
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And besides, he doesn't drink, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且他不喝酒 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:41.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:43.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:45.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:50.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj is going through some stuff right now and he'd like to take up drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:50.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉出了点状况 他想开始喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:55.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here you go, Leonard. One Tequila Sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:55.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧 莱纳德 一杯龙舌兰日出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:08:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This drink is an example of how liquids with different specific gravities...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:08:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这杯酒说明了不同重力的液体…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:03.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...interact in a cylindrical container.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:03.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在圆柱形容器里会有什么样的互动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:06.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:06.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:08.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Raj, what'll it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:08.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 你要喝什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:11.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:12.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whatever you recommend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:12.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}由你来建议
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about a Grasshopper? I make a mean Grasshopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蚱蜢怎么样？我蚱蜢调得特别棒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:17.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay? Good, coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:17.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吗？马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:21.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, what are you gonna have? -I'll have a Diet Coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:21.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 你要喝什么？ -我要喝健怡可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:26.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, can you please order a cocktail? I need to practice mixing drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:26.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能点杯鸡尾酒吗？我得练习调酒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. I'll have a virgin Cuba Libre.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我喝无酒精自由古巴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:33.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's rum and Coke without the rum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:33.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是不加兰姆酒的兰姆酒可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:37.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So Coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:37.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以 只要可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.39,0:08:42.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And would you make it diet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.39,0:08:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能给我健怡的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:48.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a can in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:48.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冰箱里有一罐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.45,0:08:53.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A Cuba Libre traditionally comes in a tall glass with a lime wedge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.45,0:08:53.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自由古巴一般会装在高杯里 用柠檬片做装饰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:55.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then swim to Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:55.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就游到古巴去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bartenders are supposed to have people skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}调酒师要擅长应付客人才是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Raj, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:06.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:06.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 下一个是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd like to try a Slippery Nipple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要春光外泄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you're cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你别喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:18.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anybody need a refill?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:18.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁要续杯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:20.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where did my life go, Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:20.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的人生怎么会这样 佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:26.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One day I'm a bachelor, and the next I'm married...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:26.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前一天我还是单身汉 隔天我就结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:30.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and driving a minivan to peewee cricket matches in suburban New Delhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:30.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开着迷你面包车到新德里郊区 参加板球小联盟比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:33.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:33.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在跟我说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:36.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there another Penny here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:36.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里还有别的佩妮吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:40.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had such plans. I had dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:40.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有很多计划和梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was going to be the Indira Gandhi of particle astrophysics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要当粒子天体物理学的甘地夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:46.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But with a penis, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:46.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然我多了个小鸡鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:49.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:49.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ever since I was a little boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我小的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:54.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...my father wanted me to be a gynecologist like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:54.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸要我跟他一样当妇产科医生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.18,0:09:58.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can I be a gynecologist? I can barely look a woman in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.18,0:09:58.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么能当妇产科医生？ 我根本不敢正眼看女人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:04.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I'm not going to let my parents control my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:04.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗？ 我再也不会让我爸妈控制我的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:06.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's time for a showdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:06.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该表明立场了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:08.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somebody give me a computer with a Webcam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:08.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁给我台有摄像头的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.07,0:10:13.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Sweetie, I think that's the Grasshopper talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.07,0:10:13.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 甜心 我想那是酒后胡话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:14.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's about to tell my parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:14.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得告诉我爸妈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that I'm not riding an elephant down the aisle with Lalita Gupta.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不要骑着大象 跟拉丽妲古普塔走上红毯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:20.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:20.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one can make you get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有人能逼你结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:25.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you meet this girl, see what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:25.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干脆跟这个女孩见面 看看会有什么发展？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:28.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Haven't you been listening? I cannot talk to women.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:28.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没听到我的话吗？ 我没办法跟女人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:31.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Raj-- -No, no, let's see how long it takes him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:31.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拉吉… -不…看看要过多久他才反应过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:34.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, honey...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:34.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 甜心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you say you can't talk to women but you've been talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说你不能跟女人说话 但你一直在跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.97,0:10:40.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now we'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.97,0:10:40.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们永远无法知道答案了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.93,0:10:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. I--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.93,0:10:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:45.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:45.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在跟你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Penny. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.15,0:10:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.15,0:10:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:52.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, now, I need to make sure I have a Lalita...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:52.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我得在跟蚱蜢见面前
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:55.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...before I meet the Grasshopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:55.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喝下一杯拉丽妲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:00.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a sweet green miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:00.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是甜美的绿色奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:04.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're gonna drink on this date, just promise me you won't overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:04.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你要在约会前喝酒 答应我你不会太过火
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:06.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Overdo what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:06.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么太过火？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:08.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:08.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快乐？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Freedom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自由？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:15.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This warm glow inside of me that promises everything's going to be all hunky dunky?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:15.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我身体里的暖意 代表一切都会变得喜悦满足？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.97,0:11:17.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.97,0:11:17.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you bring her to my restaurant so I can keep an eye on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干脆带她到我的餐厅来 让我盯着你？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:22.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:22.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:26.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's the plan? Let's say he meets her, he likes her, they get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:26.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}计划是什么？假设他跟她见面 他喜欢她 他们结了婚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:29.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's he gonna do, stay drunk for the rest of his life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:29.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他该怎么办？一辈子当酒鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:32.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It worked for my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:32.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸妈就可以
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:37.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PLAYING SLOW MUSIC ON PIANO]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:46.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe I'm sitting here next to little Lalita Gupta.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:46.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信 我正坐在小拉丽妲古普塔旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:48.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:48.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:50.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little Lalita.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:50.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小拉丽妲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.92,0:11:52.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's kind of fun to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.92,0:11:52.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么说真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little Lalita, little Lalita, little Lalita.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小拉丽妲…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You should try it. -Oh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你该试试看 -没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:03.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have lost so much weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:03.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你瘦了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:07.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That must have been difficult for you because you were so, so fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:07.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定很辛苦 因为你以前真的很胖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:13.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes, I do. -Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:13.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我记得 -你当然记得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:16.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who could forget being that fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:16.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁能忘记自己曾经那么胖？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I've been trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直都想忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.70,0:12:22.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So you're a dental student? -Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.70,0:12:22.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是牙医系学生？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm! Are you aware that dentists have an extremely high suicide rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道牙医的自杀率非常高吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:31.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not as high as air traffic controllers, but there are far more dentists...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:31.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有空中交通管制员高 但牙医的人数…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:35.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...than air traffic controllers, so in pure numbers, you're still winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:35.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要比交通管制员多 所以就人数来说还是牙医领先
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.38,0:12:37.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yay, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.38,0:12:37.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:40.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you have a drink that'll make him less obnoxious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:40.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有什么酒能让他不要那么讨人厌吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.18,0:12:43.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Drinks do not work that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.18,0:12:43.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酒没有这种功能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:46.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd say he's doing fine. Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:46.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得他还不错 看看她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:49.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The last girl my mom set me up with had a mustache and a vestigial tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:49.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上次我妈帮我安排的相亲对象 有胡子还有退化的尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:53.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sorry I'm late. -What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:53.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-抱歉我迟到了 -发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. I just really didn't wanna come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 我真的不想来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:13:01.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Virgin diet Cuba Libre, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:13:01.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无酒精的健怡自由古巴 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:05.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay. -In a tall glass with a lime wedge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:05.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 -我要高杯跟柠檬片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:08.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'll wedge it right in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:08.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一定会帮你“插”进去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how's Koothrappali--?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}库萨帕里还…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.67,0:13:16.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -That's Princess Panchali.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.67,0:13:16.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -那是庞查丽公主
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:18.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm pretty sure her name's Lalita.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:18.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信她叫拉丽妲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. Princess Panchali from The Monkey and The Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…《猴子与公主》里的 庞查丽公主
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.05,0:13:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, I tried to watch that online but they wanted my credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.05,0:13:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我想在线看那部电影 但他们要我的信用卡资料
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:30.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a children's story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:30.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是童话故事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I was a little boy and got sick, which was most of the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我小时候生病 这种情况很多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:39.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...my mother would read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:39.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通常我妈会读那个故事给我听
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.03,0:13:43.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's about an Indian princess who befriends a monkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.03,0:13:43.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是在描述 一个印度公主跟猴子当朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who was mocked by the other monkeys because he was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它被其他的猴子嘲笑 因为它跟其他猴子不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:49.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For some reason, I related to it quite strongly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:49.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道为什么 我对这个故事非常有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We all know the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.92,0:13:57.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, what are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.92,0:13:57.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你到底想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:14:01.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That woman looks exactly like the pictures of Princess Panchali in the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:14:01.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个女人长得就像书里的庞查丽公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:05.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How often does one see a beloved fictional character come to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:05.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个人有多少次机会能看到 自己喜欢的虚拟角色在眼前出现？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:08.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every year at Comic-Con.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:08.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每年的动漫展
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:10.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every day at Disneyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:10.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每天的迪士尼乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:12.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can hire Snow White to come to your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:12.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以聘请白雪公主到你家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:15.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, they prefer it if you have a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 如果你有孩子的话 他们会觉得更加自在点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys. This is Lalita Gupta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大伙儿们 她是拉丽妲古帕塔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:21.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lalita, this is Leonard and Sheldon and Howard and Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:21.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉丽妲 他们是莱纳德 谢尔顿、霍华德跟佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.03,0:14:24.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't it great? She isn't fat anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.03,0:14:24.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很棒吧？她现在不胖了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.61,0:14:26.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forgive me, Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.61,0:14:26.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原谅我 公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:29.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for I am but a monkey and it is in my nature to climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:29.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是只猴子 我天生就爱爬
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:33.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did not mean to gaze upon you as you comb your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:33.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我无意在你梳头发时吓到你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:39.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are the living embodiment of the beautiful Princess Panchali.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:39.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你简直是美丽的庞查丽公主真人版
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no kidding. Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧 她是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A beloved character from an Indian folktale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}印度民间传说里 深受大家喜欢的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:47.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Us Indian or "come to our casino" Indian?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是在说印度人 还是保留区赌场的印第安人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You Indian. -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}印度人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:56.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The resemblance is remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:56.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的太像了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:15:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can practically smell the lotus blossoms woven into your ebony hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:15:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我简直能闻到你乌黑的秀发里 散发出来的莲花香
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:04.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I imagine you smell very nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:04.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你闻起来也很香
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:08.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I shower twice a day and wash my hands as often as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:08.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一天洗两次澡 有机会就洗手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.41,0:15:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.41,0:15:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.33,0:15:14.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you're a dentist, he's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.33,0:15:14.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你是牙医 他是疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't be insulting, Rajesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要骂人 拉吉希
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:21.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Sheldon, tell me more about this princess you say I look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:21.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 跟我说说 你说的那个跟我长得很像的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was said that the gods fashioned her eyes out of the stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}据说神用星星做出她的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:29.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and that roses were ashamed to bloom in the presence of her ruby lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:29.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟她的鲜艳红唇相比 连玫瑰都会自惭形秽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:31.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:31.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:34.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Back off, Sheldon. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:34.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-走开 谢尔顿 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you do not stop hitting on my lady, you will feel the full extent of my wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你继续泡我女人 你会领教到我的怒火
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not hitting on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有在泡她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:42.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I am not your lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:42.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且我不是你的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you have no wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也没有怒火
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:48.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are my lady. Our parents said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:48.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是我的女人 我们的爸妈说好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We are, for all purposes, 100 percent hooked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们完全可以算是在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:52.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's get something straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:52.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得把话说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only reason I came tonight was to get my parents off my case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚我会出现 是不希望我爸妈继续来烦我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't need to be getting this old-world crap from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不会接受你的老派作风
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:03.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the kind of spirit with which Princess Panchali led the monkeys to freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:03.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}庞查丽公主就是这样 说服猴子争取自由的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Screw Panchali. -You can't talk to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-去他的庞查丽公主 -你不能这样对我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:07.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you're not Princess Panchali.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你又不是庞查丽公主
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:10.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Luckily for you. She could have you beheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:10.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算你走运 不然她会砍掉你的头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:13.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, are you hungry? -I could eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:13.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 你饿了吗？ -我可以吃点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:15.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:15.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:19.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:19.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.98,0:16:21.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Beats the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.98,0:16:21.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:25.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll tell you what happened. I just learned how to pick up Indian chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:25.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来告诉你们发生了什么事 我知道该怎么泡印度妞了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:30.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. KOOTHRAPPALI: What are we supposed to say to Lalita's parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:30.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们该怎么跟拉丽妲的爸妈说？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.66,0:16:33.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I play golf with her father. I won't be able to look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.66,0:16:33.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟她爸一起打高尔夫球 我都不敢再看他了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:36.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you should keep your eye on the ball, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:36.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你该认真看球 爸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:40.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, now you're a funnyman? This is not funny, Mr. Funnyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你在耍幽默吗？ 这一点都不好笑 幽默先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:45.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. and Mrs. Koothrappali, in all fairness, it wasn't entirely Raj's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:45.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}库萨帕里医生跟太太 事实上这不完全是拉吉的错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:48.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-This is a family matter, Sheldon. -No, I'm Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:48.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是我们家的事 谢尔顿 -不 我是莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:51.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Sorry. You all look alike to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:51.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 对我们来讲 你们长得都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:54.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But he's right, Papa. Listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:54.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说得对 爸爸 听他说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:57.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你 是你毁了这一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:57.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You, you are the one who ruined everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:16:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who is it? We can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:16:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁来了？我们看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:01.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Turn us. Turn us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:01.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮我们转过去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go ahead, tell my parents why they won't have any grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧 告诉我爸妈 为什么他们没办法抱孙子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:10.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How would I know? Do you have a low sperm count?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:10.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么知道？你的精子数量太低？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:14.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This has nothing to do with my sperm count.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:14.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这跟我的精子数量无关
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are wearing the boxers that we sent you, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在穿我们寄给你的内裤吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.45,0:17:18.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.45,0:17:18.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:22.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what happens to the samosas when you wear the tighty whities.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:22.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道穿紧身内裤 对你的元宝会有什么影响
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:25.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can we please stop talking about my testicles?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:25.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们能不能别谈我的睪丸？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, tell them what you did. -What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 跟他们说你做了什么 -我做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:30.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You left with his date.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:30.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟他的约会女伴一起离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:32.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends don't do that to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:32.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}朋友不该那么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:35.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 现在我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:41.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sorry. -"Sorry"? That's all you can say is "sorry"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:41.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-抱歉 -“抱歉”？你就只能说抱歉？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:44.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take it, Raj. It's more than I've ever gotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:44.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接受吧 拉吉 你的待遇要比我好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:45.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And may I point out...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:45.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想指出…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:48.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...she wouldn't have asked me to go if you weren't drunk and boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:48.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不是你喝醉了又无聊 她也不会约我吃饭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:51.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Drunk? -And boring. Her words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:51.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-喝醉？ -而且无聊 那是她说的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:54.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I knew it, he moves to America and becomes an alcoholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:54.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就知道 他搬到美国就变成酒鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:56.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not an alcoholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:56.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是酒鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.82,0:17:58.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then why were you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.82,0:17:58.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你为什么会喝醉？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was just this one time, Papa, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有这一次 爸 我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you in denial? Do we have to come over and do an intervention?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在否认吗？我们得过去帮你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:06.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't embarrass him in front of his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:06.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别让他在朋友面前没面子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:08.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Carry us outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:08.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 带我们到外面去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We want to talk to you in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要私下跟你谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-But, Papa, please-- -Now, Rajesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-爸 拜托 -快点 拉吉希
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:18.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:18.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:24.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}DR. KOOTHRAPPALI: Now, listen to me-- -At least wait till I get into the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:24.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你给我听好… -等我到了走廊再说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:27.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.69,0:18:28.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.69,0:18:28.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:31.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:31.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happened with you and Lalita?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟拉丽妲怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:37.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We ate, she lectured me on the link between gum disease and heart attacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:37.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们一起吃饭 她跟我说了 一堆牙周病跟心脏病的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...nothing I didn't already know, and I came home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我早就知道了 所以我就回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:43.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you're not gonna see her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:43.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不会再跟她见面？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:45.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would I see her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:45.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为什么要再跟她见面？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:48.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I already have a dentist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:48.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经有牙医了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.05,0:18:56.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wonder who's gonna tell his parents that they're not having grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.05,0:18:56.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道谁要告诉他爸妈 他们没办法抱孙子了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING AND PLAYING "TO LIFE"]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.81,0:19:02.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To life, to life, l'chaim
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:05.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}L'chaim, l'chaim, to life
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:07.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Life has a way of amusing us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:09.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Blessing and bruising us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:14.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Drink l'chaim, to life
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.95,0:19:19.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't believe it. What's gotten into him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.95,0:19:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信 他是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:24.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, maybe a couple of virgin Cuba Libres that turned out to be kind of slutty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:24.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许一两杯无酒精自由古巴 让他变得放荡了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:26.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLES] You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:26.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you do your experiments, I do mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们会做实验 我也会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.42,0:19:32.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To life
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[VOCALIZING]
